# fossil-mcp reads no environment configuration.
# The repository, alias and permissions are fixed by command-line flags at startup:
#   fossil-mcp --repo-id notes -R /path/to/repo.fossil
#   fossil-mcp --repo-id notes -R /path/to/repo.fossil --allow-local-writes --state-dir /path/to/private/state
# Secrets never belong in environment variables or config files for this server;
# credential-bearing search was removed (see CHANGELOG.md).
